  "title": "mesa-ibi-scanner",
  "description": "<p><strong>Research prototype</strong> that evaluates <strong>MESA Invariant 1</strong> (directed inbound trifecta closure Cl(b)) over a typed agent/service interaction graph, with PDP cut semantics, topology JSON ingestion, and CI-friendly text/JSON/SARIF output.</p><p>Not for production policy enforcement. Companion ACM and topology JSON Schemas included. Companion preprint: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22743175\">10.5281/zenodo.22743175</a> (concept DOI; latest version <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22761743\">10.5281/zenodo.22761743</a>).</p>",
